      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on a grant proposal for my conservation non-profit and i need some help with the tone. can u draft a paragraph for me that explains why managed conservation is an outdated, human-centric model that fails to address the true needs of the ecosystem? i want to make the case that rewilding is the only way forward.",
